      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Holy shit, so it's another thing i can scratch in my to do list for fun, it's getting less and less stuff we can create. They destroy more and more and never have a clue what they did.\n\nYou can point it out and as always the devs won't understand how to fix it!\n\nWhere is our local lagg fix we pointed out months ago with Raivo making an example Avatar for Tupper personally?\n\nWhere is our fixed joint fix? We are still FORCED to use an animator with Root motion enabled.\n\nI could name more and more.\n\nIt's just getting more and more Bugs which they never fix for us creators.\n\nWELL WELL WELL BETTER LIMIT CREATORS EVEN MORE WITH SHOWING ALL GAMEOBJECTS ON THE AVATAR TO MAKE PEOPLE ASSUME MORE AND MORE THINGS.\n\nWe were the Heroes of this game once, now we are being treated like trash.\n\nBetter make the Game Quest ready :^)\n\nThere is some good stuff, good changes we got, i think we can play more than 3 audio sources at once now, which enables some cool stuff, i didn't test it yet, but if i want to do it it's possible.\n\nBut it just would be better to fix exisisting bugs.\n\nThe bug that just got named is really big.\n\nLocal Lagg on animations is still a thing, most of us Animators want to quit because of it. \"Im creating something right now, if it laggs locally again i quit.\"\n\nPlease just don't focus on new UI Stuff, more limits for us or the website etc. Just fix things.\n\nThe two most important Animator groups that existed are slowly dying because we feel like it's not worth it anymore.\n\nThanks for listening to my rant.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
