      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5adf8a9fa2fe006ef1504f6a|full_name}: VRChat became a big home for me. I chill with normies, animators, clubbers and all sorts of people. I remember the first days, we were amazing ppl, we avoided that the game integrated particle limiter happened that would have ruined the game forever, we are here for almost 2 years, tryna lead the game trough the fair middle of normies and diehard animators. And so far it has been pretty disappointing, but it worked halfway.\nNow we have to beg the devs for their mercy to fix this devastating issue and let us continue make unique and lovely moments and memories even better with our personal influence from animations and other creative additives.",
      "viewerReactions": null
