      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5c0dd6fc56e25840e02411a1|full_name}: I strongly suspect that the change to Networked IK was driven by the decision to support Quest, which in turn was a decision most likely driven by Facebook paying them to do so. It's unfortunate the devs had not figured out a way to monetize the game prior to this change because there's zero chance they're going to roll it back now. They're probably contractually obligated to continue support for Quest, and even if they weren't if they dropped support next week they'd piss of a huge number of people who bought the Quest specifically for VRChat.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
